      "content": "the problem is there's no one to talk to. that's the point. everyone i thought was my friend just... stopped. even my family acts like i'm some kind of ghost or a mistake they'd rather not mention. there is literally no bridge back to them. i'm just a ghost walking around in a body that doesn't even matter to anyone anymore.",
